title: "Introducing Plant-Based Analogs to Restaurants: data pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Data pipeline for a study of whether introducing plant-based analogs to
  restaurant menus reduces meat and animal-based purchases. Covers raw
  point-of-sale exports through cleaning, menu-item labeling and aggregation to
  the modelling dataset.
